 the problem?</br>", "id": 1, "time": "7500", "image": "engenn3le02ob10re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:      There is a really long lineup.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:      Hmm. OK, one moment. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:  Where are you going?", "id": 2, "time": "13000", "image": "engenn3le02ob10re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Hello? Peter?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Hey, Sally!", "id": 3, "time": "28000", "image": "engenn3le02ob10re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Where are you?<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I'm lining up for you at the Batman stand!", "id": 4, "time": "33250", "image": "engenn3le02ob10re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: You're so sweet!\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I know ...", "id": 5, "time": "39500", "image": "engenn3le02ob10re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Text me when you are near the front. Good thinking, Peter!\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Thanks! People are waiting for Michael Keaton's autograph!", "id": 6, "time": "45500", "image": "engenn3le02ob10re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Michael Keaton! The original Batman! Cool!\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I want to take a photo with him! Should I get one for you?", "id": 7, "time": "54000", "image": "engenn3le02ob10re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Wait for me, Peter!\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Maybe ... just kidding!", "id": 8, "time": "64000", "image": "engenn3le02ob10re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Not funny! OK, I'm just lining up for some food. See you soon!<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Bye!", "id": 9, "time": "70000", "image": "engenn3le02ob10re2img01.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn3le02ob10re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn3le02